### Feature Session — REFRESH (Rotación + Reuse Detection)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3004

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.$.refresh_token}}

### 1. Rotar token de refresco
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 2. Intentar reutilizar el token anterior (debe retornar 401 y revocar la familia)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}
